  "description": "The hostkey event: the connection, the fingerprint in OpenSSH SHA256 form, and first_use. It is sent only when a key was accepted on first use, so first_use is always true at this tag; a known key needs no event and a changed key is an error, never a hostkey. A collected run must show one between connect and connected.",
